{
 "encounter_id": "00834",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE",
  "person_4": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "G'day, Maureen. I'm Josie, the nurse. I'll weigh you and take your pulse before the doctor. How are you travelling? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, I'm good, love. Well, I'm tired, that's why we're here. And this is my carer, Bridget, she drives me. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Pulse 62, blood pressure 118 over 72, weight 66 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hi Maureen, hi Bridget. I'm Dr Chen. So, tired. Tell me about it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've been tired all the time for a month, doctor. I'm worn out by two in the afternoon. I wonder if it's my thyroid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Why do you wonder about the thyroid? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Because I had it treated last year, the radioactive iodine, and I've been on the thyroid tablets since. My sister says it's the thyroid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's a good thought. How are you sleeping, and how's your appetite? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I sleep well, nine hours, and I'm eating well. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any feeling of being cold, constipation, dry skin?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit cold, yes. And dry skin on my shins."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your mood? Any low mood, or lost interest in things?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I'm not low. I'm just tired. I'm perfectly fine in my mood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "She has been low, doctor. She hasn't wanted to go to her craft group for weeks. And she's cried a couple of times."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bridget, honestly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll note both, Maureen, that you say your mood is fine, and Bridget's noticed you've been withdrawn. What medicines do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Levothyroxine, 100 micrograms, once a day, before breakfast. And vitamin D, 1000 units."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you take the levothyroxine on an empty stomach? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mostly. With my tea. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tea and calcium can reduce absorption. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, none, love."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you drink alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A sherry on Sundays."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at you. Josie did your pulse, it's a little slow. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that bad? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It can fit with an underactive thyroid. Let me feel your thyroid area and check your reflexes.",
   "pause": 20.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your skin is dry, your reflexes are slow, and there's no lump in the neck."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "Is it the thyroid, doctor? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Possibly. After thyroid treatment, the tablet dose often needs adjusting. I'd say this could be an underactive thyroid from too low a dose, but I can't rule out another cause of tiredness, such as anaemia or low mood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What do we do? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a blood test for your thyroid function, your blood count, and your iron and vitamin B12 levels."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can take it right now. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like a blood sugar, to be complete."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "In the meantime, take the levothyroxine on its own, with water, half an hour before breakfast, and don't have tea or milk with it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And Maureen, if your mood gets lower, or you feel hopeless, please tell us."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will, I promise. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you get very drowsy, very cold, confused, or short of breath, come in straight away."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
